{"id":"u34","kelas":10,"no":8,"judul":"Rangkuman Kelas 10","title":"Review Kelas 10","emoji":"🎓","ringkas":"Latihan campuran semua materi kelas 10","ready":true,"goals":["mengulang **perkenalan diri**, simple present, dan present continuous","mengulang struktur dan bahasa **descriptive**, **recount**, **procedure**, dan **narrative text**","mengulang **announcement**, **invitation**, dan strategi **membaca teks pendek**","mengerjakan **latihan campuran** dari seluruh materi Kelas 10"],"lesson":[{"t":"intro","text":"Ini unit terakhir Kelas 10. Kamu **mengulang semuanya**: perkenalan, empat jenis teks utama, teks fungsional pendek, dan strategi membaca. Baca rangkuman di bawah, lalu kerjakan Latihan dan Kuis."},{"t":"grammar","title":"1. Rangkuman jenis teks","table":[["Jenis teks","Tujuan","Struktur","Ciri bahasa"],["**Descriptive**","mendeskripsikan satu hal","Identification, Description","simple present, adjective, has/have"],["**Recount**","menceritakan pengalaman","Orientation, Events, Re-orientation","simple past, first/then/finally"],["**Procedure**","menjelaskan cara melakukan sesuatu","Goal, Materials, Steps","kalimat perintah, kata urutan"],["**Narrative**","menghibur dengan cerita","Orientation, Complication, Resolution","simple past, past continuous"],["**Announcement**","memberi informasi kepada banyak orang","what, when, where, who, contact","will be held, please, don't forget"],["**Invitation**","mengajak orang datang","acara, tanggal, jam, tempat, RSVP","You are invited to ..."]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"2. Rangkuman grammar","table":[["Topik","Ingat"],["**Simple present**","kebiasaan dan fakta: [[I live in Bandung.]] / [[She lives in Bandung.]]"],["**Present continuous**","sedang terjadi: [[I am studying now.]]"],["**Simple past**","selesai di masa lalu: [[We visited Bali last year.]]"],["**Past continuous**","sedang berlangsung: [[I was reading when he called.]]"],["**Imperative**","perintah: [[Add the sugar.]] / [[Don't touch it.]]"],["**has / have vs is / are**","memiliki vs keadaan: [[She has long hair.]] / [[She is tall.]]"],["**Preposisi**","[[on]] hari/tanggal; [[at]] jam/tempat; [[in]] bulan/tahun/ruangan"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"3. Kata penghubung dan urutan","table":[["Jenis teks","Kata yang dipakai"],["Recount","[[first]], [[then]], [[after that]], [[finally]]"],["Procedure","[[first]], [[next]], [[then]], [[finally]]; [[Make sure ...]], [[Be careful ...]]"],["Narrative","[[once upon a time]], [[one day]], [[suddenly]], [[finally]]"],["Announcement","[[We are pleased to announce ...]], [[Don't forget to ...]]"]]},{"t":"grammar","title":"4. Strategi membaca","table":[["Strategi","Ingat"],["**Skimming**","baca cepat untuk gambaran umum"],["**Scanning**","cari informasi tertentu (jam, nama, angka)"],["**Main idea**","biasanya ada di topic sentence"],["**Reference words**","it, they, this, there merujuk pada hal yang sudah disebut"],["**True / false / not given**","jawab hanya dari isi teks"]]},{"t":"tip","title":"Tips mengerjakan soal","text":"Baca soal dua kali, garis bawahi kata kunci, coret pilihan yang jelas salah, lalu cek jawabanmu dengan kalimat di teks. Untuk soal grammar, cari **petunjuk waktu** (yesterday, now, every day) dan **bentuk kata kerja** setelah subjek."},{"t":"dialog","title":"Dialog: Mengulang pelajaran","lines":[{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Class, which text tells us how to make something?","id":"Anak-anak, teks mana yang memberi tahu cara membuat sesuatu?"},{"who":"Dina","en":"A procedure text. It has a goal, materials, and steps.","id":"Teks prosedur. Teks itu punya tujuan, bahan, dan langkah-langkah."},{"who":"Ms. Sari","en":"Good. And which text has a complication and a resolution?","id":"Bagus. Dan teks mana yang punya komplikasi dan penyelesaian?"},{"who":"Tom","en":"A narrative text, like a folk tale.","id":"Teks narasi, seperti cerita rakyat."}]},{"t":"summary","items":["Empat teks utama: **descriptive, recount, procedure, narrative**, masing-masing punya struktur dan tense sendiri.","Teks pendek: **announcement** dan **invitation** memuat what, when, where, who, dan kontak.","Strategi membaca: **skimming**, **scanning**, ide pokok, dan reference words.","Selamat, Kelas 10 selesai! 🎉"]}],"practice":[{"type":"match","q":"Pasangkan jenis teks dengan tujuannya:","pairs":[["descriptive","mendeskripsikan sesuatu"],["recount","menceritakan pengalaman"],["procedure","menjelaskan cara"],["narrative","menghibur dengan cerita"]],"exp":"Setiap jenis teks punya tujuan.","k":"f58bc088"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Teks yang memakai kalimat perintah adalah...","options":["procedure","narrative","recount","descriptive"],"answer":0,"exp":"Procedure memberi instruksi.","k":"849fa09b"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense utama pada recount dan narrative adalah...","options":["simple past","simple present","future","present perfect"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kejadian sudah selesai di masa lalu.","k":"25b588b9"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Tense utama pada descriptive text adalah...","options":["simple present","simple past","past continuous","future"],"answer":0,"exp":"Deskripsi umumnya memakai simple present.","k":"6854172e"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Bagian narrative yang berisi masalah adalah...","options":["complication","orientation","resolution","goal"],"answer":0,"exp":"Complication = masalah.","k":"67984780"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Kata yang dipakai untuk urutan langkah adalah...","options":["first, then, finally","because, so, but","and, or, if","who, what, where"],"answer":0,"exp":"Kata urutan.","k":"0b0ef575"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She lives in Bandung.","She live in Bandung.","She living in Bandung.","She lives at Bandung city."],"answer":0,"exp":"she + verb-s.","k":"f4e19e08"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["I am studying English now.","I studying English now.","I studies English now.","I am study English now."],"answer":0,"exp":"am + V-ing.","k":"e5e5b850"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["We visited Bali last year.","We visit Bali last year.","We visiting Bali last year.","We have visit Bali last year."],"answer":0,"exp":"last year memakai simple past.","k":"25fa6704"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Pilih kalimat yang benar.","options":["She has long black hair.","She is long black hair.","She have long black hair.","She are long black hair."],"answer":0,"exp":"has = memiliki.","k":"8fb436ec"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Preposisi yang tepat: \"The meeting is ___ Monday at 8 a.m.\"","options":["on","at","in","by"],"answer":0,"exp":"on + hari.","k":"b571d803"},{"type":"fill","id":"Tambahkan gula ke dalam gelas.","q":"___ the sugar to the glass.","answers":["add","Add"],"hint":"perintah","exp":"Imperative memakai kata kerja dasar.","k":"b483d90f"},{"type":"fill","id":"Jangan menyentuh kompor yang panas.","q":"___ touch the hot stove.","answers":["don't","Don't","do not","Do not"],"hint":"larangan","exp":"Don't + kata kerja dasar.","k":"e40a62d0"},{"type":"fill","id":"Ketika aku tiba, dia sedang membaca.","q":"When I arrived, she ___ reading.","answers":["was"],"hint":"was / were","exp":"Past continuous: was + V-ing.","k":"579054d1"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pada suatu hari, seekor kancil pergi ke sungai.","q":"___ day, a mouse deer went to the river.","answers":["one","One"],"hint":"satu","exp":"one day = suatu hari.","k":"6aad44eb"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Namaku Dina dan aku tinggal di Bandung.\"","answer":"My name is Dina and I live in Bandung.","exp":"Perkenalan diri memakai simple present.","k":"552ed282"},{"type":"order","q":"Susun kalimat: \"Lomba akan diadakan di aula.\"","answer":"The contest will be held in the hall.","exp":"will be held + tempat.","k":"edffad44"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Make sure the water is hot","options":["Pastikan airnya panas","Airnya sudah dingin","Jangan minum airnya","Beli air panas"],"answer":0,"exp":"Make sure = pastikan.","k":"fddaa80a"},{"type":"listen","q":"Dengarkan. Apa artinya?","say":"Suddenly the lights went out","options":["Tiba-tiba lampu padam","Lampu menyala terus","Lampu dibeli kemarin","Kami suka lampu"],"answer":0,"exp":"suddenly = tiba-tiba.","k":"331696bc"},{"type":"mcq","q":"Cara membaca untuk mencari jam acara adalah...","options":["scanning","skimming","menghafal","menulis ulang"],"answer":0,"exp":"Jam adalah informasi tertentu.","k":"fc18af4c"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dia tinggal di Jakarta.","q":"She ___ in Jakarta. (live)","answers":["lives"],"hint":"she + verb-s","exp":"she lives.","k":"33707747"},{"type":"fill","id":"Dari mana asalmu?","q":"Where ___ you from?","answers":["are"],"hint":"to be","exp":"Where are you from?","k":"34a87cbb"},{"type":"fill","id":"Senang bertemu denganmu.","q":"Nice to ___ you.","answers":["meet"],"hint":"bertemu","exp":"Nice to meet you.","k":"01aba592"},{"type":"fill","id":"Rumah itu besar dan cantik.","q":"The house ___ big and beautiful.","answers":["is"],"hint":"is / are","exp":"Keadaan memakai is.","k":"d02ab7df"},{"type":"fill","id":"Mereka memiliki taman yang luas.","q":"They ___ a large garden.","answers":["have"],"hint":"has / have","exp":"they have.","k":"a1eb2644"},{"type":"fill","id":"Pertama, cuci tanganmu.","q":"___, wash your hands.","answers":["first","First"],"hint":"pertama","exp":"first = pertama.","k":"be1b6342"},{"type":"fill","id":"Hati-hati dengan pisau itu.","q":"Be ___ with the knife.","answers":["careful"],"hint":"hati-hati","exp":"Be careful = hati-hati.","k":"88fd2ce5"},{"type":"fill","id":"Akhirnya mereka tiba di rumah.","q":"___ they arrived home.","answers":["finally","Finally"],"hint":"akhirnya","exp":"finally = akhirnya.","k":"d2377c99"},{"type":"fill","id":"Sambil aku makan, adikku bermain.","q":"___ I was eating, my brother was playing.","answers":["while","While"],"hint":"sambil","exp":"while + past continuous.","k":"8473e1e6"},{"type":"fill","id":"Kami dengan senang hati mengumumkan hasil lomba.","q":"We are ___ to announce the results.","answers":["pleased"],"hint":"senang","exp":"W